Package: katu-store
Version: 1.0.1
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Katu OS Team <katuos@gmail.com>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-pyqt5 | python3-pyside6, katu-core, flatpak
Priority: optional
Section: misc
Description: Katu Store — App Store
 Graphical app store for Katu OS. Install software without
 using the terminal. Supports APT, Flatpak and web apps.
 Includes Brasil section with government and financial services.
